 how  you're doing once you have completed all  five activities you will be able to  download your certificate of completion  you will receive an email shortly after  with instructions on requesting your  t-shirt if you're interested in more  training and education resources for  em cells be sure to visit the Learning  Center here you can participate in  various gibco virtual training labs  including basic cell culture  transfection and pluripotent stem cell  culture recorded PSE training modules  from our stem cell experts are also  available don't miss out on these great  educational and training resources there  are two areas to listen to the  presentations available in this event  on-demand presentations are here watch  these presentations at your leisure or  save them to your briefcase for later  the live presentations and schedule of  events can be found here this is your  chance to connect with thought leaders  and prominent researchers from around  the world in the exhibit hall you can  visit booths to learn about new  technologies products and resources  available to support your stem cell  research there are a few things to  mention about your experience in the  exhibit hall in a booth you can view and  learn about new products and services  offered by thermo fisher scientific for  stem cell research browse the different  resources available by application you  can choose to view them now or save them  for later by adding them to your virtual  briefcase here you can find a schedule  of the live chats that will be hosted by  thermo fisher scientific sardi experts  visit during your topic of interest join  the conversation and ask our team your  questions from modeling diseases to  discovering therapies and perhaps one  day even offering cures stem cells have  the potential to change the way we think  about medicine sharing new findings  research approaches and connecting with  other researchers is a great way to move  stem cell research forward thank you for  attending today's virtual event
 

